                          "text": [
                            "The sled register\nlists the city as\nowner. Its repair\ncharge was",
                            "paid from a public\nfund. Storage is\nthe only unpaid\nitem. A penciled",
                            "note says\nequipment cannot\nbe pledged by a\ndriver. Moxie\nlooks",
                            "deeply relieved by\nthis detail."
                          ],
